"form":"10-Q","filed":"2025-10-30"},"0001628280-26-028526":{"c":"META","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-04-30"},"0001628280-26-050705":{"c":"META","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-07-30"},"0001628280-26-066773":{"c":"META","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-10-22"}},"finsights":{"META":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $46.1 billion in FY2025: operating cash flow of $116 billion less capital spending of $69.7 billion (computed from two filed figures). That is 22.9% of revenue. In FY2020 it was $23.6 billion.","cites":["META.ocf.2025","META.capex.2025","META.revenue.2025","META.ocf.2020","META.capex.2020"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $20.4 billion in FY2025, 10.2% of revenue, against 7.6% in FY2020.","cites":["META.sbc.2025","META.revenue.2025","META.sbc.2020","META.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $26.2 billion to repurchase its own shares and $5.3 billion in dividends: $31.6 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["META.buybacks.2025","META.dividends.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $64.6 billion, up 26.1% from $51.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["META.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","META.d.revenue.2025-07-01.2025-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $242 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $79.4 billion and net income to $75.2 billion.","cites":["META.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","META.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","META.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","META.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","META.d.revenue.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","META.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","META.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","META.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","META.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","META.d.opinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30","META.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","META.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","META.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","META.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","META.d.netinc.2026-07-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $28.6 billion: operating cash flow of $133 billion less capital spending of $104 billion (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["META.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","META.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","META.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","META.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","META.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-09-30","META.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","META.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-30","META.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","META.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-06-30","META.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.1 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $772 million a year earlier.","cites":["META.deferred.2025","META.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 78,865 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $2.5 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["META.q.employees","META.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $35.9 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $45.7 billion in short-term investments, and $58.7 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $22.8 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["META.cash.2025","META.sti.2025","META.debtLong.2025"]}]},"fin":{"META":{}},"quotes":{"META.q.employees":{"c":"META","kind":"employees","n":78865,"quote":"We had a global workforce of 78,865 employees as of December 31, 2025, and we have offices in more than 90 cities around the world.","source":"META-0001628280-26-003942","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-01-29","proof":"6f8ecb1260344b05b67114d12c6991200a9eed04735befb20b0fe5ae43bbfa15"}}}